WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.320
- One of the biggest issues
of unhappiness in 2022

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.810
in America and beyond,

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:09.239
is the complete and utter
lack of accountability.

00:00:09.239 --> 00:00:11.670
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.470
I'm passionate about accountability.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:18.070
I think the unbelievable vulnerability

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:19.470
in our ecosystem right now

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:22.253
is people not being
accountable for themselves.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.890
We are now in the
finger-pointing generation.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.330
It's your fault, it's their fault,

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.030
it's this institution's fault,

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.270
it's this human being's fault.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.240
People think technology's changing us,

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.860
I think it's exposing us.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.370
This thing is your gateway
to get out of the thing

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.670
that you complain about.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:42.490
But people would rather
complain about how it is

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:43.540
than put in the work.

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:49.380
When you go into blame
game, you are vulnerable.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:52.130
People would rather
default into why they can't

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:54.370
than putting in the actions
that allow them to can.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.721
I am remarkably stunned

00:00:56.721 --> 00:01:00.730
by the lack of accountability
in our society.

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.220
Do you know how liberating it is

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.240
when you realize everything's your fault?

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.004
It gets real fucking good out here.

00:01:06.004 --> 00:01:06.837
(camera shutters click)

00:01:06.837 --> 00:01:08.010
Something I'm just thinking a lot about

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.420
is I'm asking people
to be more accountable,

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:11.650
but I have to be careful,

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:14.770
because a lot of people's version
of intaking accountability

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:16.270
is beating themselves up.

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.120
Just stop judging yourself.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.940
Everybody else is doing
it for you already.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.430
Everybody just wants to point fingers

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:23.150
24 fucking hours a day

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.380
and tell you why everybody
else is doing things wrong

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:27.400
in the system, that person, this...

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.250
Just fucking firing fingers 24/7

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:32.820
without a thumb and a mirror ever.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.130
Figure out what your fucking thing is

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:35.876
and stop making fucking bullshit excuses.

00:01:35.876 --> 00:01:37.800
I just want it so bad for you.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:38.898
I want it bad for you.

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.420
Zero accountability.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:41.960
It has been completely eliminated.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:45.063
We must put accountability on a pedestal.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.760
If you're like, "Well, Gary, fuck you,

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.660
I grew up in a family
that was very pessimistic

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:50.830
and this is what it is."

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:52.100
Well then what do you want?

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.270
Then go to therapy, right?

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:55.990
Do something, fight for it.

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:59.510
Fight to be happy,
listen to positive shit.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:01.110
That's a funny game.

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:02.620
Miraculous thing happens when you cut out

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.010
your most pessimistic friend,

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.160
you become more optimistic.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:08.230
News alert, you're deciding
what life actually is.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.701
It is your subjective call.

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:11.670
(inspiring music)

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:14.270
This is a game of perspective.

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:16.560
I don't understand how
we don't understand that.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:19.360
There's a very big difference
between, "I'm accountable,"

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:23.337
and, "It's my fault," and, "I
suck, I'm a piece of shit."

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:27.130
It's perspective.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:29.030
I think about World War II.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:31.930
I think about so many genocides.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.660
I think about the people
and the millions of people

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.450
around the world that don't
have clean water every day.

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:42.320
I'm not capable of dwelling,
because of gratitude.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:46.100
Accountability, what
am I gonna do about it?

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.210
And perspective.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.480
And so, I'm what do I say?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.610
I say we should be thankful

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.330
that we can even have this conversation,

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.010
health over everything,

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:57.497
and just perspective, man,
it's just perspective.

00:02:57.497 --> 00:03:01.164
(inspiring music continues)

00:03:24.753 --> 00:03:27.500
My friends, do you know how
rare it is to have a life?

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.350
The odds right now, currently,

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:33.080
that science accepts for the
odds of actually being alive

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.967
is 400 trillion to 1.

00:03:34.967 --> 00:03:36.379
(children voices)

00:03:36.379 --> 00:03:37.539
One life, baby.

00:03:37.539 --> 00:03:38.830
One life.
- One life.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:39.747
- One life.

00:03:42.957 --> 00:03:45.202
- One life.
- One life, one.

00:03:45.202 --> 00:03:46.202
- One.
- One.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.387
If you are a good person
and you're trying,

00:03:49.387 --> 00:03:52.120
truly trying and not
trying to hurt anybody,

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.959
you're fucking phenomenal.

00:03:53.959 --> 00:03:56.438
(audience applauds)

00:03:56.438 --> 00:03:57.271
Enough.

00:03:57.271 --> 00:03:58.773
Lack of accountability.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.150
This is the key to the whole thing.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.330
The mindset of accountability

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:07.060
is what makes you win, makes you happy,

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:08.723
whether it's true or not.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.200
Got it?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.670
The thought of taking on responsibility

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:16.400
for everything that's
not working is the win

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.900
whether you're right or wrong.

00:04:19.409 --> 00:04:22.742
(inspiring music fades)

